  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile avgpool helps both RNA and image, but image-only ResNet remains much weaker than RNA (0.328 vs 0.650), and ViT image representation is untested. config_014 tests whether a stronger image encoder improves image-only accuracy under the same multiprofile avgpool setting as config_011, isolating image representation. This is the best next experiment because it is a one-factor comparison, balances exploration of the image modality with exploitation of the preferred profile/aggregation, and clarifies whether image features are worth adding in multimodal fusion before spending budget on more complex fusion configurations."
}

